  "remarks": "Olga Sokolova is the general manager of the LLC “UAMOC” a Russia-based company which produces First Person View (FPV) drones for the Russian Armed Forces. The company was founded after the start of Russia’s full-scale war against Ukraine and rapidly expanded its production. LLC “UAMOC” produces FPV drones “Kort”, “Brus-1”, “Osa” and “Boomerang”, which are used in the war against Ukraine. It also launched a production and testing facility in the illegally occupied Luhansk and Sevastopol.",
